  "description": "Contains the DbContext necessary to implement the historian.  EF Historian is designed to be inherited from as the new base DbContext.  It enables automatic auditing of any EF controlled table.  Build your models and signal to EF Historian that you'd like to track the changes of a model.  EF Historian will assign a runtime type matching the model identified and use it to track changes.",
